{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熊喵不在后，我才注意到了很多我已经习以为常的事情。", "text_idx": 107, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那只不可思议的动物，\\n对我们来说到底有多么重要。", "text_idx": 108, "plain": "那只不可思议的动物，对我们来说到底有多么重要。", "plain_idx": 109, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后的教学楼内。", "text_idx": 110, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "仿佛还能听到熊喵那“溜溜”的充满元气的声音混在学生们的笑声里。", "text_idx": 111, "plain": "仿佛还能听到熊喵那“溜溜”的充满元气的声音混在学生们的笑声里。", "plain_idx": 111, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……新吾，辛苦你了」", "text_idx": 113, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2232", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你也是」", "text_idx": 115, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐与往常一样，即使是自由到校期间也会来到活动室。", "text_idx": 116, "plain": "学姐与往常一样，即使是自由到校期间也会来到活动室。", "plain_idx": 116, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天，我第一次听到学姐哭泣的声音，看到她的眼泪。", "text_idx": 117, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但我没能对她说出鼓励的话语。", "text_idx": 118, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——请振作起来。", "text_idx": 119, "plain": "——请振作起来。", "plain_idx": 119, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "哪怕是这样简单的一句话，或许都能让她稍微振作一点，但我什么都说不出来。", "text_idx": 120, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家似乎也注意到了学姐的心情，没有提起过熊喵的话题。", "text_idx": 121, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「昨天真是抱歉。让你看到了我丢人的一面」", "text_idx": 122, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2233", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有的事……」", "text_idx": 124, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵现在应该正在和母亲撒娇吧～」", "text_idx": 125, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2234", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 127, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「肯定非常幸福吧。\\n　毕竟是和最喜欢的母亲在一起」", "text_idx": 128, "plain": "「肯定非常幸福吧。　毕竟是和最喜欢的母亲在一起」", "plain_idx": 129, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2235", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我也是这么想的」", "text_idx": 131, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 127, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2236", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一直以来最喜欢的学姐的笑容，\\n现在看上去却那么地痛苦……", "text_idx": 133, "plain": "我一直以来最喜欢的学姐的笑容，现在看上去却那么地痛苦……", "plain_idx": 134, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我从早上就一直在思考着。", "text_idx": 135, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我现在该怎么做。", "text_idx": 136, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我能为我最喜欢的人做些什么。", "text_idx": 137, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个，新吾。\\n　回去的时候要顺路到我家来吗？」", "text_idx": 138, "plain": "「那个，新吾。　回去的时候要顺路到我家来吗？」", "plain_idx": 139, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2237", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学姐方便吗？」", "text_idx": 141, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，不会给你造成麻烦就行……」", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2238", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么会麻烦呢」", "text_idx": 144, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我笑着握住学姐的手。", "text_idx": 145, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我比任何人都更想陪在她身边，让她展露笑容。", "text_idx": 146, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「太好了♪」", "text_idx": 147, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2239", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "很快，学姐就要从这所学校里毕业了。", "text_idx": 149, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在这有限的时间里。", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我现在，只能多陪伴在她身边。", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没错，我只能这样默默陪伴她。", "text_idx": 152, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要学姐笑了，我也就能笑出来。", "text_idx": 153, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而学姐无法露出笑容的时候，我就去拥抱她。", "text_idx": 154, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们就这样既不积极也不消极地，\\n持续着原地踏步。", "text_idx": 155, "plain": "我们就这样既不积极也不消极地，持续着原地踏步。", "plain_idx": 156, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
